{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p095a","title":"张郃等急引曹操入船","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p095a-account","label":"《曹瞒传》","text":"《曹瞒传》记马超赶至渡河处，张郃等急引曹操入船，敌骑追射，诸将见曹操生还悲喜交集。","evidence":["wudi-e-p095a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"渡河遇险","evidence":["wudi-e-p095a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"追射","evidence":["wudi-e-p095a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"护入船","evidence":["wudi-e-p095a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"西征渡河时","year":211,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p095a-q","wudi-q-o128","wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b"],"chronology":"wudi-y211","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o128","basis":"西征渡河时","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,775,"P095a"],"order":321}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0183","name":"张郃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p095a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4399c5c8cefaac589857","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《曹瞒传》曰：“公将过河，前队适渡，超等奄至。公犹坐胡床，不起；张郃等见事急，共引公入船。河水急，比渡，流四五里。超等骑追射之，矢下如雨。诸将见军败，不知公所在，皆惶惧。至见，乃悲喜，或流涕。公大笑曰：‘今日几为小贼所困乎！’”","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4e0863e1b7cedb4c1fdf","start":0,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o128",